veld is a fork of shodh-memory and has been EXTENSIVELY MODIFIED by Portll.
Files throughout this repository have been changed, added and removed relative to
the original. Treat every file as changed unless you have diffed it against
upstream yourself.

The fork point was imported as a single squashed commit (3e4d7ca, "veld v0.7.7"),
so this repository's git history does NOT show the upstream authorship it is built
on. That history is at the upstream repository below. Do not read `git log` here as
a record of who wrote what before the fork point.

